        {
          "id": 1934488,
          "username": "hizachlee",
          "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/community.shopify.com/hizachlee/{size}/416069_2.png",
          "created_at": "2026-11-08T06:52:26.907Z",
          "cooked": "<p>With weight-based rates, Shopify adds a rate for each location. Turn off “available to fulfill online orders” on the second store, so checkout sees one origin and charges once. Online orders then only use the first store’s stock.</p>",
